            <div xml:id="d93">

                <pb facs="0221" n="109" sameAs="frus:frus1918/pg109"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.001H85/1</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Chinese Minister</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Koo</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-09-14">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 14, 1918</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the
                    receipt of your note No. 74 of the 5th instant, in which, by instruction of your
                    Government, <pb facs="0222" n="110" xml:id="pg110"/> you advised me that His
                    Excellency Hsü Shih-ch’ang has been elected President of the Republic of China
                    for the next term in accordance with the laws of that Republic.</p>
                <p>Thanking you for the information contained in your note, of which due note has
                    been taken, I beg [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
